While exploring the Olympus Mons area in search of the lost relics, the 5th Platoon has come in contact with a large CCA contingent. They are pinned down in fierce combat and have already lost their Recycler. They need your help.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Assist the 5th platoon.
- Look for Cthonian relics.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
The SLF has been equipped to build and launch the Day Wrecker bomb as well as build the solar flare mine.

The Recycler can now build mobile construction rigs, which are capable of building armories, repair hangers, satellite comm towers, long range radar arrays, gun towers and various power supplies. 

Your command HUD indicates where you can construct buildings. Green indicates terrain suitable for building while red means that the terrain is either rough or you are too close to another structure. Yellow means you could build there, but you would not have a power supply (solar, lightning or wind) for the structure.